+#   1 snapshot + integrity  — live integrity_check=ok, in-container backup(), docker cp,
+#                             host sqlite3 integrity_check=ok on the copy, WAL sidecars
+#                             checkpointed + removed so the snapshot is one self-contained file
+#   2 pull                  — service-targeted pull (omniroute-base only; redis untouched)
+#   3 digest match          — pulled RepoDigest == flagged target digest
